  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&apos;Taxation of the Digital Economy and Capital Gains &amp; Indirect Transfer of Assets&apos; training for Uganda Revenue Authority (March 2023) (face-2-face course in Kampala)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">From 11-14 March 2024, IBFD implemented two successful back-to-back courses on the Taxation of the Digital Economy and Capital Gains &amp; Indirect Transfer of Assets, for a total of 35 and 25 officials (respectively) from the URA.  These courses are a follow-up from the recommendations of the BEPS Assessment Tool (B.A.T.) Report. The B.A.T. was carried out in Uganda in 2023</narrative>
  </description>
